    "faq": {
      "type": "vb-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {"type":"q","settings":{"question":"When should I switch from Essentials to Breastfeeding?","answer":"<p>Switch the day baby is born. Breastfeeding contains higher calcium, iron, and DHA + EPA tuned for milk production and postpartum recovery — different from pregnancy demands.</p>"}},
        "q2": {"type":"q","settings":{"question":"How long should I take Breastfeeding?","answer":"<p>For the entire breastfeeding journey. Most mums take it 6-24 months, until weaning. After weaning, switch to Her-Biotics or a daily multi.</p>"}},
